// (no top-level flat call), each branch carrying its own NPC line plus dialog calls, and a preservable
// simple statement (an assignment / side-effect call) kept byte-exact. This is editable with per-branch
// grouping - mirrors the SSL bundle case (`if (c) then begin ... end else begin ... end`) in TS syntax, so
// the source parser must classify it `bundleFaithful` with an `if` branch and an `else` branch, not demote
